  "details": "I’m on fiber and i ping 5ms or bellow on basically everything. A year or two ago i was pinging 13-14 and now its suddenly gone up to 20-22ms of ping. I hate that i can notice delay within speech during a conversation and i understand its very niche but yeah i was hoping something could be done about that. Disable nagles algorithm since VRChat uses TCP would be my only suggestion although im not sure if thats a terrible idea or not.",
